cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use FathomNet, please cite the article below."
type: dataset
title: "FathomNet"
abstract: >-
  FathomNet is an open-source image database for understanding the ocean and its inhabitants. It
  contains expertly annotated underwater images with bounding boxes and classifications.
